2026-11-06T02:56:31.1014116Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1014512Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1014859Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1015315Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1015819Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1026398Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1027176Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1038327Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1038952Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:56:31.1039390Z 
